  "body": "Some homes are simply places to live. Others become part of the family's story.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful cul-de-sac, 8 Yacht Place is one of those rare properties. Cherished by the same family for more than 20 years, it has been a place where children have grown up, milestones have been celebrated and memories have been made. Set on a generous 857m² freehold site, this well-maintained single-level home offers space, privacy and versatility for today's families, while also presenting exciting possibilities for the future.\r\n\r\nFeaturing five bedrooms (including a master suite with walk-in-robe) and a separate study, this beautiful home provides the versatility modern families need, whether it's space for children, guests, hobbies or working from home. \r\n\r\nTwo bathrooms, including a master ensuite, help everyday life run smoothly, while the modern galley-style kitchen sits at the heart of the home, offering generous storage and bench space for everything from busy weekday mornings to weekend entertaining. The home's connection to the outdoors is where it truly comes into its own.\r\n\r\nBeautifully landscaped gardens, with colourful blooms, lovely roses and a fruit orchard, create a charming setting to enjoy throughout the seasons. At the rear, an expansive entertaining deck flows from the kitchen and dining area, overlooking the gardens and a wide, level lawn. A covered pergola and spa pool complete the picture, offering inviting spaces to relax and entertain, with plenty of room for children and pets to play.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been overlooked either. A covered carport, generous off-street parking and ample room for a boat, camper or additional vehicles ensure there's space for everything that comes with an active family lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the sought-after school zoning for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School. Adding to the appeal, the property enjoys private rear access to Bucklands Beach Intermediate, offering an easy connection to school life that busy families will value. \r\n\r\nBeyond its lifestyle credentials, the substantial freehold site may also attract buyers looking towards the future. With services already on-site, there may be scope to explore development or land-use opportunities, subject to council approval and purchasers completing their own due diligence.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a home with room to grow, a private haven for family life, or a substantial freehold site with future potential, 8 Yacht Place presents a compelling opportunity in a tightly held location.\r\n\r\nFor years, this has been a place where family and friends have come together to celebrate life's milestones and everyday moments alike. Now it's ready for you to make it yours.",
